* how will the player try to stop the bad thing
    - they will think of human common sense practical direct ways to stop a thing
    - it needs to be contrived so that the pragmatic ways are disabled and the more fun ways are the only option



* game gives contrived scenarios to facilitate intended gameplay
    - anything can be made into a puzzle if the environment is restricting enough
    - restricting all the pragmatic direct ways, design the options and tools so that there is only 1 right indirect way to beat the challenge
    - an epic stakes motivation can dependant on a contrived puzzle, therefore giving the puzzle importance by association (its like win theis bejewled game in time or the king dies, king gives the high stakes, jewels give the puzzle, but there is no logical connection between why the jewels are the obstacle of life or death)
